  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "asn2wrs.py: fix Needs64b",
  "description": "New Spec E2SM has the asn1 defination like this :\nRANParameter-ID ::= INTEGER (1..4294967296, ...)\n\nthe asn2wrs.py will generate the C code using: dissect_per_constrained_integer(...), the max parameter is 4294967296 that big than 32 bit cause overflow, actually should need to using dissect_per_constrained_integer_64b(...)",
