          "id": 1018531892,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "yes, using your example \"INTEGER (-8589934592..-8589934590, ...)\", I generate the code, it's also problem, this is the code:\n![image](/uploads/323943d02af70265209e4da37ddb07f8/image.png)\nbut you check the declare of the function:\n![image](/uploads/ee5f63abe4fc062da8e6ab4ab0bd6055/image.png)\nthe parameter min is guint32 is only 32 bits,, the from picture 1, the value -8589934592 is a value big than 32 bits, that will cause overflow and result in error",
